  "description": "GIZVUG crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P 21 21 21. Reported CIF formula moiety: C72 H128 Eu4 O20,4(C7 H8). From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu4 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.849-4.103 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 98.40-107.09°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula {[Eu(μ3-η2-OCH2CH2OMe)(η2-OCH2CH2OMe)(OC6H3iPr2-2,6)-][H+]}4·4C7H8.",
